ins/341110d4-21d9-4915-8ed3-bc1e386da10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8eaef712670d2f046520137851789ae, https://si.imgix.net/d00edd3a/uploads/origins/341110d4-21d9-4915-8ed3-bc1e386da10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=052732fe6a5b1a748d6ed6c8ade0b2f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d00edd3a/uploads/origins/341110d4-21d9-4915-8ed3-bc1e386da10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=321c2179c611c067db0c0dcd6dfa1dec 3x"}, "body": "Hello. I love your art! Your piece of Menace Alchemilla really drew my attention: https://skeb.jp/@mukuri999/works/9\n\nCan you draw VTuber Iekushi Chapipi ( https://twitter.com/IekushiChapipi )?\n\nChapipi is a computer virus and a bit of a brat, but also gets flustered and embarrassed easily! She can also sing very well. She's very talented and tries to provide a lot of variety! This includes being cute sometimes, cool other times, and seductive when she wants to be.\n\nCan you draw Chapipi in a suit of armor of your design? Including a cyberspace theme into a medieval suit of armor would be really cool! I will leave everything up to you, but Chapipi using a steampunk computer terminal would make a great theme.\n\nChapipi may want to use your work for SNS or thumbnails, so please decline the request if that is not okay.\n\nThank you!\n\nCharacter References:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1-uBi3Z7N6zLhdHN0WRO15K68lwrEVjLG?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mukuri999/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1623527, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2fe98051/uploads/origins/80048713-8f1a-4eab-8d96-25f820b0e315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2993a3dc030